WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.149
For capabilities, start in core slash include and read the selected package plus derived parameters.

2
00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:14.297
For scheduling and state updates, follow the issue and commit modules with the design documentation.

3
00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:19.087
For integration, inspect the application processing unit directory.

4
00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:23.233
For tests, start in verification and its smoke regression.

5
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:26.735
Fix a repository revision before comparing files.

6
00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:36.100
A useful first task is to explain one parameter and trace its effect, rather than trying to understand every module in one sitting.

